My focus is on utilizing Hierarchical Bayesian Analysis (HBA) to analyze the bioaccumulation process of  organic contaminants in the  food chain, as well as how environmental factors impact this process.  I require the construction of a hierarchical Bayesian model using the hBayesDM package in R, aimed at quantifying the influence of temperature on the enrichment of antibiotics in the planktonic planktonic food web and on the efficiency of food chain transfer. I am learning from here https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-021-03352-2. Where can I start this modeling process？

